  "changes": [
    "Read-only browser collector for explicitly selected HD/account/Qi/payment stores plus retained inventory",
    "Double collection of monotonic revisions establishes a common point for selected journal states",
    "Rejects changes to first or last journal, missing/tombstoned/corrupt state, duplicate sources and bounds without retry",
    "Returns ownership-proved guarded WalletBackup with public scope/identity/revision evidence",
    "Cancellation drops guarded origins and performs no storage writes"
  ],
